{"title":"2012 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the value of\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/3/e03ccfd89a8cb66e0d387919f33e7b64b31878b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(0^{\\circ}) + \\sin(60^{\\circ}) + \\sin(120^{\\circ}) + \\sin(180^{\\circ}) + \\sin(240^{\\circ}) + \\sin(300^{\\circ}) + \\sin(360^{\\circ})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"607\" height=\"20\" /></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Evaluating, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/8/a18bd710f3c583802ce65d30055c8e61cd29745e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(0^{\\circ}) + \\sin(60^{\\circ}) + \\sin(120^{\\circ}) + \\sin(180^{\\circ}) + \\sin(240^{\\circ}) + \\sin(300^{\\circ}) + \\sin(360^{\\circ}) = 0 + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} + 0 - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} + 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"905\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/0/ce067a231ee5d7b9e0e49667b1a8147ee31413d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"201\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/d/abdb407f58a63c2e882b288f4783c4ad830e5af9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/a/f8ab609928594bc235aa29cd934f15b4ee743eb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\sin(x) = \\sin(360^{\\circ} - x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"194\" height=\"20\" /> for any value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/8/c482c7e56dc3df73afaefcad38622146669c3776.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(180^{\\circ} \\times n) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"140\" height=\"20\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/0/4505bedfe3ce7b501899d3a71af9048a3dfb0d23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(0^{\\circ}) + \\sin(60^{\\circ}) + \\sin(120^{\\circ}) + \\sin(180^{\\circ}) + \\sin(240^{\\circ}) + \\sin(300^{\\circ}) + \\sin(360^{\\circ}) = 0 + \\sin(60^{\\circ}) + \\sin(120^{\\circ}) + 0 - \\sin(360^{\\circ} - 240^{\\circ}) - \\sin(360^{\\circ} - 60^{\\circ}) + 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/6/f068a609d68a27d37246ecb758360cb5c6c5b77e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\sin(60^{\\circ}) + \\sin(120^{\\circ}) - \\sin(120^{\\circ}) - \\sin(60^{\\circ})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"355\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/d/abdb407f58a63c2e882b288f4783c4ad830e5af9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017230400\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 54/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2738/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.406      1 2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    7.406      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36047:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017230400 and revision id 279733. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}